@host = http://localhost:5158

### List products
GET {{host}}/api/products

### Search by part of the name
GET {{host}}/api/products/search?name=star

### Products with stock between min and max (inclusive)
GET {{host}}/api/products/stock-level?min=0&max=5

### One product
GET {{host}}/api/products/100001

### Categories (needed when creating a product)
GET {{host}}/api/categories

### Create
POST {{host}}/api/products
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Lens cloth",
  "description": "Microfiber",
  "price": 12.50,
  "stock": 20,
  "categoryId": 3
}

### Update
PUT {{host}}/api/products/100001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Primo Star",
  "description": "Upright microscope used in teaching labs.",
  "price": 2450.00,
  "stock": 6,
  "categoryId": 1
}

### Decrement stock
POST {{host}}/api/products/100005/decrement-stock/1

### Add stock
POST {{host}}/api/products/100007/add-to-stock/2

### Delete
DELETE {{host}}/api/products/100006
